   * @remarks
   *
   * Example:
   *
   * ```ts title="Check if property is a mix of multiple values"
   * if (node.type === 'RECTANGLE') {
   *   if (node.cornerRadius !== figma.mixed) {
   *     console.log(`Single corner radius: ${node.cornerRadius}`)
